27:["$","ul","ul-4",{"children":["\n",["$","li","li-0",{"children":["\n",["$","p","p-0",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"总线锁定（Bus Locking）"}],"：总线锁定是一种机制，它通过锁定内存总线来确保在执行原子操作时，其他处理器无法访问内存。这种方法虽然简单，但会导致总线的其他操作被阻塞，从而影响系统性能。"]}],"\n",["$","pre","pre-0",{"data-language":"MARKDOWN","children":["$","code","code-0",{"className":"hljs language-markdown","children":["优点：\n\n",["$","span","span-0",{"className":"hljs-bullet","children":"-"}]," 绝对的原子性保证\n",["$","span","span-1",{"className":"hljs-bullet","children":"-"}]," 适用于所有内存位置\n\n缺点：\n\n",["$","span","span-2",{"className":"hljs-bullet","children":"-"}]," 性能开销大\n",["$","span","span-3",{"className":"hljs-bullet","children":"-"}]," 会阻塞其他 CPU 对内存的访问\n"]}]}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-1",{"children":["\n",["$","p","p-0",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"缓存锁定（Cache Locking）"}],"：现代处理器通常使用缓存锁定来实现原子操作。缓存锁定通过锁定处理器的缓存行来实现，而不是锁定整个总线。这种方法可以减少对总线的影响，提高系统的并发性能。"]}],"\n",["$","pre","pre-0",{"data-language":"MARKDOWN","children":["$","code","code-0",{"className":"hljs language-markdown","children":["优点：\n\n",["$","span","span-0",{"className":"hljs-bullet","children":"-"}]," 性能更好\n",["$","span","span-1",{"className":"hljs-bullet","children":"-"}]," 不会完全阻塞内存访问\n\n条件：\n\n",["$","span","span-2",{"className":"hljs-bullet","children":"-"}]," 数据必须在缓存行中\n",["$","span","span-3",{"className":"hljs-bullet","children":"-"}]," 缓存行必须是独占状态\n"]}]}],"\n"]}],"\n"]}]
